[
  {
    "version_id": 1,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "从前有一只小兔子，他很想要离家出走。有一天，他对妈妈说：\"我要跑走啦！\"",
    "image_ref": "小兔子站在屋子中间，看着妈妈。",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": null,
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 1,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "\"如果你跑走了，\"妈妈说，\"我就要去追你，因为你是我的小宝贝呀！\"",
    "image_ref": "兔妈妈弯腰看着小兔子，微笑着。",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": null,
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 1,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "\"如果你来追我，\"小兔子说，\"我就要变成溪里的小鳟鱼，游得远远的。\"",
    "image_ref": "小兔子想象自己变成了一条红色的鱼在水里游。",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": null,
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 1,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "\"如果你变成溪里的小鳟鱼，\"妈妈说，\"我就变成捕鱼的人去抓你。\"",
    "image_ref": "兔妈妈拿着钓鱼竿，鱼钩上挂着一根胡萝卜。",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": null,
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 1,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "\"如果你变成捕鱼的人，\"小兔子说，\"我就要变成高山上的大石头，让你抓不到我。\"",
    "image_ref": "小兔子想象自己变成了一块高高的石头。",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": null,
    "default_next_page_number": 6
  },
  {
    "version_id": 1,
    "page_no": 6,
    "body_text": "\"如果你变成高山上的大石头，\"妈妈说，\"我就变成爬山的人，爬到高山上去找你。\"",
    "image_ref": "兔妈妈背着背包，拿着登山杖在爬山。",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": null,
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 2,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "下雨了。小狐狸站在门口，看着外面的雨。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 2,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "妈妈说：\"带上你的小红伞吧。\"",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 2,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "小狐狸撑开伞，走进森林小路。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 2,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "路边有一只小蘑菇，也在\"打伞\"。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 2,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "小狐狸回头看，妈妈就在后面。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 6
  },
  {
    "version_id": 2,
    "page_no": 6,
    "body_text": "雨停了。小狐狸收起伞，笑了。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 3,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "夏天的晚上，池塘很安静。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 3,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "阿呱说：\"我想办一场音乐会。\"",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 3,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "可是，会有人来听吗？",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 3,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "萤火虫来了，一盏一盏亮起来。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 3,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "蜻蜓来了，青蛙们一起唱起来。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 6
  },
  {
    "version_id": 3,
    "page_no": 6,
    "body_text": "池塘的夜晚，变得很热闹。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 4,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "天黑了，小熊还不困。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 4,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "他把星星玩偶抱得更紧了。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 4,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "妈妈说：\"我们数一数星星吧。\"",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 4,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "一颗、两颗、三颗……",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 4,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "小熊睡着了，星星还亮着。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 5,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "小蜗牛决定去旅行。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 5,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "他走得很慢，一天只走一点点。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 5,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "蚂蚁跑过来：\"你怎么这么慢呀？\"",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 5,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "小蜗牛说：\"我慢慢走，也能到。\"",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 5,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "蚂蚁在坡顶等他。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 6
  },
  {
    "version_id": 5,
    "page_no": 6,
    "body_text": "太阳升起来，他们一起看到了风景。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 6,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "小女孩把一粒种子放进土里。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 6,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "她每天都来浇水。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 6,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "可是，好多天都没有动静。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 6,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "爷爷说：\"再等等，它在下面长根呢。\"",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 6,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "一天早上，两片小叶子冒出来了。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 6
  },
  {
    "version_id": 6,
    "page_no": 6,
    "body_text": "后来，她拔出了一根胡萝卜。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 7,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "小猫趴在窗台上晒太阳。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 7,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "一只蝴蝶飞过来了。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 7,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "小猫伸出爪子，轻轻扑了一下。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 7,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "蝴蝶绕了一圈，又飞回来。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 7,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "它们就这样，一起待了一下午。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 8,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "天黑了，朵朵不想睡觉。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 8,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "月亮好像在看着她。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 8,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "妈妈给她盖上小被子，被上有星星。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 8,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "一颗、两颗，星星在眨眼睛。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 8,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "朵朵闭上眼，月亮也躲进云里。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 9,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "小熊烤了一炉香面包。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 9,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "面包太多，他一个人吃不完。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 9,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "他把面包装进小篮子。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 9,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "他送给邻居小兔和小鹿。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 9,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "大家一起吃，面包更香了。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 10,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "小鸭子站在水边，不敢下水。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 10,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "妈妈说：\"水凉凉的，试试看。\"",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 10,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "他把一只脚伸进水里。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 10,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "两只脚都下去了，身体浮起来。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 10,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "他划着小脚丫，游了起来。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 11,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "小羊躺在草地上看云。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 11,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "一朵云白白的、软软的。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 11,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "他梦见自己飞到了云上。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 11,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "他揪下一小团云，像棉花糖。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 11,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "风一吹，云慢慢飘走了。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 12,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "天要下雨了，蚂蚁们很着急。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 12,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "队长说：\"大家排好队。\"",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 12,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "有的扛米粒，有的扛饼干屑。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 12,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "路很远，大家谁也不放下。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 12,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "新家门口，大家一起把粮食搬进去。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 13,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "秋天到了，树上的苹果红了。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 13,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "小刺猬打了个滚，苹果扎在背上。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 13,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "他背着苹果去看好朋友。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 13,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "小松鼠生病了，躺在床上。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 13,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "小刺猬把苹果留给朋友，轻轻走了。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 14,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "森林里有一棵老树。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 14,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "每天早上，小鸟都飞来。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 14,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "它们站在树枝上一起唱歌。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 14,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "树洞里的小松鼠也探出头听。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 14,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "风一吹，树叶沙沙地伴奏。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 15,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "小萤火虫一个人，有点孤单。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 15,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "他亮着小灯笼往前飞。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 15,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "草丛里有一点光在闪。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 15,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "原来是另一只萤火虫。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 15,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "两只小灯笼一起飞，黑夜不黑了。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 16,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "秋天，小松鼠忙着捡松果。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 16,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "他把松果埋在树洞旁边。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 16,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "冬天来了，到处都是雪。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 16,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "他挖出松果，饱饱吃了一顿。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 16,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "他知道，要提前准备。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 17,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "蒲公英开了一朵小黄花。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 17,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "花谢了，长出白色小绒球。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 17,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "风一吹，种子们撑开小伞飞走。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 17,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "一粒种子落在田野里。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 17,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "第二年春天，它长出一棵新的蒲公英。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 18,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "钟楼上的钟指到早上，小镇醒了。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 18,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "面包店开门，孩子们去上学。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 18,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "中午，钟又走到了中间。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 18,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "下午，大家在公园里玩。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 18,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "晚上，灯一盏盏灭了，小镇睡着。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 19,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "小鲸鱼跟着妈妈游大海。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 19,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "妈妈说：\"你自己游到前面看看。\"",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 19,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "他有点害怕，水很深很蓝。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 19,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "他摆摆尾巴，向前游去。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 19,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "他看到了一片美丽的珊瑚。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 20,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "雨停了，天上出现彩虹。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 20,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "小兔说：\"彩虹那边是什么？\"",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 20,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "小熊说：\"我们一起去看看。\"",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 20,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "他们走过草地，过了小桥。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 20,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "彩虹的另一端，是一片开满花的山坡。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  },
  {
    "version_id": 21,
    "page_no": 1,
    "body_text": "小老鼠住在图书馆里。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 2
  },
  {
    "version_id": 21,
    "page_no": 2,
    "body_text": "每天晚上，他都要读一本书。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 3
  },
  {
    "version_id": 21,
    "page_no": 3,
    "body_text": "有本书放得太高，他够不着。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 4
  },
  {
    "version_id": 21,
    "page_no": 4,
    "body_text": "他推来小书车，爬上去。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": 5
  },
  {
    "version_id": 21,
    "page_no": 5,
    "body_text": "书里有好多故事，他想讲给朋友听。",
    "image_ref": "/assets/placeholder.png",
    "audio_ref": null,
    "image_license_note": "NO-COMMERCIAL",
    "default_next_page_number": null
  }
]